              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k;\\frac{\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{9\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{5\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T19:42:59.295926+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\"><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"09d8b3e2-202c-44f0-8eec-50def1e70651\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/>За­ме­тим, что урав­не­ние опре­де­ле­но, если:<center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}2\\sin x+\\sqrt{2}\\ge 0,\\\\\\cos x&gt;0\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}\\sin x\\ge-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\\\\\cos x&gt;0\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow-\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k\\le x&lt;\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}+2\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}.\\quad(*)\"></span></span></p></center><p>При этих усло­ви­ях урав­не­ние эк­ви­ва­лент­но со­во­куп­но­сти:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x+\\sqrt{2}=0\\\\\\log_4 (2\\cos x)=0\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\sin x=-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\\\\\cos x=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\underset{(\\cdot)}{\\iff}\\left[\\begin{aligned}x=-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">От­бе­рем корни при по­мо­щи три­го­но­мет­ри­че­ской окруж­но­сти (см. рис.). Под­хо­дят:  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{9\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{5\\pi}{3}\"></span> . <p><b>Из­ло­жим ре­ше­ние пунк­та а) иначе.</b></p><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"d2141347-bb18-4b3d-87d5-a63fbab2f07a\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_2\"/> </p><p>Пре­об­ра­зум урав­не­ние: </p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{2\\sin x+\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot\\log_{4}(2\\cos x)=0\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\begin{cases}2\\sin x+\\sqrt{2}=0\\\\2\\cos x&gt;0\\end{cases}\\\\&amp;\\begin{cases}2\\cos x=1\\\\2\\sin x+\\sqrt{2}\\ge 0\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\begin{cases}\\sin x=-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\\\\\cos x&gt;0\\end{cases}\\\\&amp;\\begin{cases}\\cos x=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\\\sin x\\ge-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\begin{cases}\\left[\\begin{aligned}x&amp;=-\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k,\\\\x&amp;=-\\dfrac{3\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right.\\\\\\cos x&gt;0\\end{cases}\\\\&amp;\\begin{cases}x=\\pm\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k\\\\\\sin x\\ge-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\\right.\\Leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}x&amp;=-\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k,\\\\x&amp;=\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k,\\end{aligned}\\right.\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}.\"></span></span> </p></center></li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1",
                  "image_2"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
